  "whatWeDo": {
    "backedTech": "Backed by Technology",
    "backedTechDesc": "Our data are reliably informed by the large network of people and partners we have across the various countries in Africa. This data is updated regularly to provide key information about products made in Africa.",
    "monitoring": "Monitoring & Real-time Reporting",
    "productMap": "Product Mapping",
    "SeasonalityData": "Seasonality Data",
    "commodityPrice": "Updated Commodity Prices",
    "instantPayment": "Instant Payments across Africa",
    "providingVisibility": "Providing Visibility and Access to African Products",
    "providingVisibilitydesc": "Traders of Africa has provided a unified platform for buyers and suppliers of African products. We are committed to promoting goods that are grown, produced or manufactured in Africa.",
    "viewProducts": "View products",
    "buyerHub": "Buyer’s Hub",
    "buyerHubDesc": "Buyers from all over the world can easily access African products through our buyers hub. Browse through our selection of various products, ranging from agro commodities to finished goods.",
    "onlineMarket": "Online Marketplace",
    "onlineMarketDesc": "We have created a platform to showcase African products from verified suppliers across the continent. Producers and suppliers in Africa can have access to local and international markets.",
    "foreFront": "We are at the forefront of trade financing across Africa",
    "foreFrontDesc": "Through Tofa Pay, we facilitate trade by financing the supply of various agro products. Genuine suppliers of African products who have confirmed orders backed by an acceptable payment term can request for funds.",
    "foreFrontDesc2": "We can also undertake to pay on behalf of factories and processors across Africa which will assist them in managing their cashflow as well as build integrity with their suppliers.",
    "sourceProWork": "Let SourcePro do the work",
    "sourceProWorkDesc": "We have amassed a team of sourcing professionals who work 24/7 to provide products according to our buyers’ specifications. SourcePro guarantees quality, logistics and off-take solutions to both buyers and suppliers.",
    "BuildSupplyCapacity": "Build Supply Capacity with TOFA Academy",
    "BuildSupplyCapacityDesc": "Through dedicated partnerships in every African country, TOFA Academy provides training and funding to farmers and aggregators for commercial agro commodities trade.",
    "BuildSupplyCapacityDesc2": "We work closely together with SourcePro to train our cohorts on all they need to know about commercial agribusiness. We're also dedicated to providing the needed financing and direct offtake of all products. Become a member of our TOFA Tribe, where we'll mentor you for impact and monitor you for success!"
  },
